---
title: AdviseCare - Activity Diagram - WF2b Welfare Officer Handles Referral
---

flowchart TD
    S((Start)) --> A1[Welfare Officer sees the referral in the incoming queue]
    A1 --> A2[Open the referral and the advisor's finalized notes]
    A2 --> A3[Set the case priority]
    A3 --> D1{Financial matter?}
    D1 -->|No| A4[Return the referral with a reason: case goes back to its previous stage]
    A4 --> X((End))
    D1 -->|Yes| A5[Accept: the wellbeing advisor keeps the case, stage stays referred]
    A5 --> B1[Log interventions: loan arrangement, financial aid, banking paperwork]
    B1 --> D2{Grant issued?}
    D2 -->|Yes| B2[Record the support grant]
    D2 -->|No| D3
    B2 --> D3{Outside service needed?}
    D3 -->|Yes| C1[Record an external referral with a follow-up date]
    C1 --> C2[System flags it overdue if the date passes without an outcome]
    C2 --> C3[Log the follow-up outcome, then close the external referral]
    D3 -->|No| D4
    C3 --> D4{Beyond the officer's authority?}
    D4 -->|Yes| E1[Escalate to the Programme Head, see EX5]
    D4 -->|No| F1
    E1 --> F1[Close the intervention with its outcome]
    F1 --> F2[The advisor is notified and continues follow-up and closure]
    F2 --> X
